  "title": "Velvety Earthy Malaysian Water Chestnut Curry",
  "description": "A rich and creamy Malaysian curry featuring water chestnut, with an earthy flavor from binchotan-charcoal, perfect for midnight cravings. This dish is a unique blend of traditional Malaysian spices and the subtle sweetness of water chestnut.",
