  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for another minute.",
    "Stir in the curry powder and cook for 1-2 minutes until fragrant.",
    "Add the water chestnut and cook for 2-3 minutes until it is slightly tender.",
    "Pour in the coconut milk and add the binchotan-charcoal powder if using.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook for 10-12 minutes until the sauce has thickened.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Serve the curry hot over rice or with roti."
